            "text": "The absolute permittivity of the medium is defined as, $\\varepsilon=\\varepsilon_r \\varepsilon_0$\n\nThe relative permittivity of the medium can be written as:\n$\\varepsilon_r=\\frac{\\varepsilon}{\\varepsilon_0}$",
